        {
          "text": " Kosodi kedau Parao aisiikin ituŋa alosit, mam Edeke abu kitotor kes orot loka akwap naka Ipilisitian, karaida keapie; naarai abala Edeke ebe, “Diat ekuriakaros ituŋa arai keanyut ejie, kosodete aboŋor Misiri.” ",
